        <mxCell id="40" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=top;" value="robocup_localization" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="780" x="60" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="41" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#000000;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 8;fontSize=11;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="820" width="780" x="60" y="290" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="42" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;" value="MCL [20 Hz]" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="400" x="70" y="295" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="50" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;① Motion Model Update (per particle)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;trans = √(dx²+dy²)&lt;br&gt;rot2 = Δyaw − rot1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;pt[i].x += (trans + N(0, α3·trans + α4·|rot1|)) · cos(world_dir + N(0, α1·|rot1| + α2·trans))&lt;br&gt;pt[i].z += Δyaw + N(0, α5·|Δyaw| + 0.1)&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="700" x="100" y="325" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="51" edge="1" parent="1" source="50" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="60">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="60" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;② Define circle containing LandMark(ㄱ, T, X) for weight calculation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Zone-based 9-grid indexing → candidate landmark list per observation" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="700" x="100" y="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="61" edge="1" parent="1" source="60" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="70">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="70" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;③ Pre-filter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Feature type matching required (L / T / X must match)&lt;br&gt;2. Find the nearest landmark of same type around the robot&lt;br&gt;3. Check if distance to landmark is within threshold (OBS_FILTER_DIST = 1.0 m)&lt;br&gt;4. L-shape distance gate: reject if |obs_dist − exp_dist| &gt; 0.3 m" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="700" x="100" y="585" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="71" edge="1" parent="1" source="70" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="80">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="80" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;④ Weight Calculation (for each landmark observation in circle)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Calculate field coordinate using per-particle θ (RAW_X_MM, RAW_Y_MM → field px)&lt;br&gt;2. Bearing filter: reject if |obs_angle − exp_angle| &gt; 20°&lt;br&gt;3. Ball angle disambiguation: if ball visible, select match with min ball_angle_diff&lt;br&gt;4. Mahalanobis distance weight:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;   σn = INV_NORM_VAR × dist_m + 0.05&lt;br&gt;   σp = INV_PERP_VAR × dist_m + 0.05&lt;br&gt;   D² = (dn/σn)² + (dp/σp)²&lt;br&gt;   weight += CONFIDENCE × exp(−0.5 × D²)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="700" x="100" y="720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="81" edge="1" parent="1" source="80" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="90">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="90" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑤ Update Position&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Top-1 particle selection  |  Jump validation: MIN_JUMP(0.07m) &lt; jump &lt; MAX_JUMP(0.7m)  |  Variance check: std &lt; MAX_SPREAD(0.5m)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="700" x="100" y="935" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="91" edge="1" parent="1" source="90" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="100">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="100" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑥ CDF Systematic Resampling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;fc_r ~ Uniform(0, 1/N)  →  stratified sampling across CDF  →  optional Gaussian noise injection" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="700" x="100" y="1030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="110" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;⑦ Yaw Compensation (goal post pan angle)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;expected_yaw = atan2(gx − rx, gy − ry)  |  candidate_yaw = expected_yaw − pan_deg&lt;br&gt;Apply if drift &gt; 60°  |  Cooldown: IMU ignore 20 frames, re-correction lock 5 sec" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="700" x="100" y="1025" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="101" edge="1" parent="1" source="100" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="110">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="121" edge="1" parent="1" source="40" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" target="13">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="130" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Observation error is assumed negligible within REMOVE_SPACE_DIS (robocup_vision)&lt;br&gt;• noise_enable param으로 모션 모델 노이즈 ON/OFF 가능&lt;br&gt;• Ball visible 시 ball_relative_angle로 대칭 랜드마크 구분&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="780" x="60" y="1130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="21" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=default;" value="Yaw Data" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="20" width="100" x="340" y="117.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
